list.listitem:
For patients who prefer herbal preparations, prescribe the 9-component herbal preparation STW 5 (
Iberogast
) instead of other non-prescription options. It gives superior symptom relief over placebo, and similar benefit as other prokinetic agents.

A peppermint/caraway-oil-combination (
Menthacarin
) was effective in reducing symptoms and improving quality of life in patients with FD symptoms consistent with EPS and PDS at 4 weeks.
